   "source": [
    "# SpiderNet tutorial: HGSOC model training\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains SpiderNet on **HGSOC** from a processed data folder generated by `spidernet_dataloading_MIdimselection_HGSOC`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0290443b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Before you start\n",
    "\n",
    "Set `PROCESSED_DATA_DIR` to the folder produced by `spidernet_dataloading_MIdimselection_HGSOC`.\n",
    "\n",
    "That folder should contain the processed SpiderNet objects used for training, including `SpiderNet_data_pyg_list.pkl`, `LR_list.pkl`, `genenames_train.pkl`, `adata_list.pkl`, and `adata_all.h5ad`. For HGSOC downstream analyses, `metadata_sample.csv` is also recommended.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e4053100",
   "metadata": {},
